丁积木。","mw.loadExtension.patchingWarning":"JavaScript 补丁在 Bilup 中拥有完整权限。它可能窃取你的登录会话、接管你的账号、读取或修改项目和设置，或运行其他恶意代码。只有当你信任此作品的作者时才继续。","mw.loadExtension.jsExecution":"此作品通过 {name} 扩展运行 JavaScript。","mw.loadExtension.jsExecutionWarning":"它以对 Bilup 的完整权限运行。它可能窃取你的登录会话、接管你的账号、读取或修改项目和设置，或运行其他恶意代码。只有当你信任此作品的作者时才继续。","tw.loader.downloadingAssets":"下载素材中……(第 {complete} / {total} 个)","tw.loader.loadingAssets":"加载素材中……(第{complete}/{total}个)","tw.loader.preparingProject":"正在准备作品……（大型作品可能需要一些时间）","tw.loader.projectData":"加载作品中……","tw.lockdownMode":"在苹果设备上，你必须禁用{lockdownMode}","tw.lockdownMode2":"锁定模式","tw.menuBar.60off":"关闭自定义帧数模式","tw.menuBar.60on":"打开自定义帧数模式","tw.menuBar.accent":"主题色","tw.menuBar.addons":"插件","tw.menuBar.advanced":"高级","tw.menuBar.bilupHome":"Bilup 主页","tw.menuBar.bilupLogoAlt":"Bilup","tw.menuBar.bilupWordmark":"Bilup","tw.menuBar.blockColors":"积木颜色","tw.menuBar.changeUsername":"更改用户名","tw.menuBar.cloudOff":"禁用云变量","tw.menuBar.cloudOn":"启用云变量","tw.menuBar.cloudUnavailable":"云变量不可用","tw.menuBar.cloudUnavailableAlert":"无法使用云变量，可能因为你打开了编辑器。","tw.menuBar.compileError":"{sprite}:{error}","tw.menuBar.desktopSettings":"桌面设置","tw.menuBar.moreSettings":"高级设置","tw.menuBar.newFramerate":"帧率:","tw.menuBar.newWindow":"新窗口","tw.menuBar.package":"打包作品","tw.menuBar.reportError1":"一些脚本在编译时发生了错误。","tw.menuBar.reportError2":"这是一个漏洞，请将它报告给开发团队。 ","tw.menuBar.restorePoints":"还原点","tw.menuBar.saveAs":"另存为 {file}","tw.menuBar.seeInside":"转到源代码","tw.menuBar.createRestorePoint":"创建还原点","tw.menuBar.runtime":"运行时","tw.menuBar.extensions.addImport":"添加扩展","tw.menuBar.extensions.manage":"管理扩展","tw.menuBar.customThemes":"自定义主题","tw.menuBar.theme":"主题","tw.menuBar.wallpaper":"壁纸","tw.menuBar.fonts":"字体","tw.menuBar.menuBarAlign":"菜单栏对齐方式","tw.menuBar.align.left":"左对齐","tw.menuBar.align.center":"居中对齐","tw.customThemes.create":"从当前主题创建新主题","tw.customThemes.createGradient":"创建渐变主题","tw.customThemes.export":"导出全部主题","tw.customThemes.import":"导入主题","tw.customThemes.empty":"无自定义主题","tw.wallpaper.n