e":"Bilup 教程","onboarding.step1.title":"欢迎来到 Bilup!","onboarding.step1.content":"跟随导览，探索 Bilup 的独特之处。","onboarding.step2.title":"搜索无处不在","onboarding.step2.content":"用搜索栏快速定位积木、变量、广播和角色代码。","onboarding.step3.title":"强大的窗口管理","onboarding.step3.content":"自由拖拽、随心调整、随时置顶，多任务从未如此轻松。","onboarding.step4.title":"灵活布局，随心调整","onboarding.step4.content":"拖拽分隔线，调节舞台、背包和积木面板的大小。","onboarding.step5.title":"打造专属界面","onboarding.step5.content":"在设置中挑选喜欢的主题、配色、壁纸和字体。","onboarding.step6.title":"一切就绪!","onboarding.step6.content":"您可以随时在编辑菜单中查看此教程。现在去创造精彩的作品吧!","onboarding.next":"下一步","onboarding.startCreating":"开始创作","onboarding.skipTutorial":"跳过教程","onboarding.replayTutorial":"重播教程","tw.addons.title":"插件","tw.customThemes.createDialog.createButton":"创建","mw.customThemes.empty.hint":"从当前外观创建，构建渐变，或浏览 BilupTheme 商城。","mw.customThemes.empty.create":"创建主题","mw.customThemes.empty.marketplace":"浏览商城","mw.customThemes.tab.library":"主题库","mw.customThemes.tab.create":"创建","mw.customThemes.tab.importExport":"导入 / 导出","mw.customThemes.active":"使用中","mw.customThemes.editGradient":"编辑渐变","mw.customThemes.create.fromCurrent":"从当前外观","mw.customThemes.create.gradient":"渐变","mw.customThemes.create.snapshot":"当前外观","mw.customThemes.create.fromCurrent.hint":"保存强调色、界面模式、积木、壁纸和字体。","mw.customThemes.create.save":"保存到主题库","mw.customThemes.import.hint":"从 Bilup 文件加载主题。","mw.customThemes.import.choose":"选择文件","mw.customThemes.export.hint":"将主题库中的每个主题下载为一个 JSON 文件。","mw.customThemes.export.button":"导出","mw.customThemes.marketplace.hint":"浏览社区主题并将其添加到您的主题库。","mw.customThemes.marketplace.open":"打开","mw.accentGroup.colors":"颜色","mw.menu.biluptheme":"BilupTheme 商城","bl.menu.bilme":"Bilme 商城","bl.bilme.title":"Bilme 商城","bl.bilme.searchPlaceholder":"搜索主题...","bl.bilme.sortBy":"排序方式","bl.bilme.newest":"最新","bl.bilme.likes":"最受欢迎","bl.bilme.name":"名称","bl.bilme.allPlatforms":"所有平台","bl.bilme.bilup":"Bilup","bl.bilme.allColors":"所有颜色","bl.bilme.red":"红色","bl.bilme.orange":"橙色","bl.bilme.yellow":"黄色","bl.bilme.green":"绿色